{"code":"PP09","wikidata":"Q73811536","wikipedia":{"en":"Yaek Nonthaburi 1 MRT station","th":"สถานีแยกนนทบุรี 1"},"summary":{"en":"Yaek Nonthaburi 1 station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Purple Line. The station opened on 6 August 2016 and is located on Rattanathibet road in Nonthaburi Province. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีแยกนนทบุรี 1 เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางของรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายฉลองรัชธรรม ตั้งอยู่เหนือถนนรัตนาธิเบศร์ในพื้นที่อำเภอเมืองนนทบุรี จังหวัดนนทบุรี และมีอาคารจอดแล้วจรที่สามารถจอดรถได้ 430 คัน"},"opened":"2016-08-06","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/201701_Yaek_Nothaburi_1_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Yaek_Nothaburi_1_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Yaek_Nothaburi_1_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Central_Rattanathibet_20260101_153815.jpg/960px-Central_Rattanathibet_20260101_153815.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Central_Rattanathibet_20260101_153815.jpg","author":"Jothefiredragon","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Central_Rattanathibet_20260101_153855.jpg/960px-Central_Rattanathibet_20260101_153855.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Central_Rattanathibet_20260101_153855.jpg","author":"Jothefiredragon","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Central_Rattanathibet_20260101_154432.jpg/960px-Central_Rattanathibet_20260101_154432.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Central_Rattanathibet_20260101_